  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After an ancient soul beast dies, Ying Wu Xie, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and Hei Lou Lan surround the corpse and search for the soul core inside the body. Soul beasts nurture a soul core about the size of an egg, holding a large number of soul path dao marks and ranking as a top tier refinement material. Other than that core, the soul beast’s corpse disappears after some time and has no use.",
      "chapters": [
        1042
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "no-lasting-corpse-material",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "sys_soul_beast"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan brings a desolate beast level soul beast’s corpse before him, it turns into whiffs of dark grey smoke and keeps dissipating with the wind. He cannot stop that loss, and after a while only a glass-like soul core remains in his hand.",
